hout revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_discomfortsAndInconveniences": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_risksIncludingDiscrimination": {"finding": "Requires Modification", "remarks": "Reviewers split on criteria. Committee clarification required.", "is_modified": false}, "f11_investigatorsAdequatelyTrained": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f11_vulnerabilityMechanismsInPlace": {"finding": "Requires Modification", "remarks": "Reviewers divided. Revisions required: Primary Reviewer: Bilingual community health workers assist in facilitating tele-consultations.; Maria Santos: Protection against clinical exploitation and adverse psychiatric events is severely deficient.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_expectedDurationOfParticipation": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_alternativeTreatmentsOrProcedures": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_randomAssignmentToTrialTreatments": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_adequateProcessForVoluntaryConsent": {"finding": "Requires Modification", "remarks": "Reviewers split on criteria. Committee clarification required.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_refusalOrDiscontinuanceWithoutPenalty": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_writtenInSimpleUnderstandableLanguage": {"finding": "Requires Modification", "remarks": "Reviewers split on criteria. Committee clarification required.", "is_modified": false}, "f11_researchQuestionsSupportedByLiterature": {"finding": "Satisfactory", "remarks": "Satisfactory; criteria met without revisions.", "is_modified": false}, "f12_